### **Entity Relationships**

| Relationship | Detail |
| :---- | :---- |
| d\_complaints → d\_complaint\_item | One Complaint → Many Items. d\_complaint\_item.ticket\_id → d\_complaints.complaint\_id (Primary Relation — child of BO) |
| d\_complaints → d\_complaint\_voices | One Complaint → Many Voices. d\_complaint\_voices.ticket\_id → d\_complaints.complaint\_id (Primary Relation — child of BO) |
| d\_complaints → d\_complaints\_attachment | One Complaint → Many Attachments. d\_complaints\_attachment.complaint\_id → d\_complaints.complaint\_id (Primary Relation — child of BO) |
| d\_complaints → d\_customers | One Customer → Many Complaints. d\_complaints.customer\_id → d\_customers.customer\_id (Non-Primary Relation) |

 

