| Item | Convention |
| :---- | :---- |
| App ID | customer\_complaints\_\<your\_prid\>   e.g. customer\_complaints\_pr0045 |
| Display Name | Customer Complaints Application — \<Your Name\> |
| Role 1 (Creator) | Employee  (precedence: 3\) |
| Role 2 (Assignor) | Manager  (precedence: 2\) |
| Role 3 (Resolver) | ResponsibleTeam  (precedence: 1\) |
| Test User (Employee) | emp\_\<your\_prid\>   e.g. emp\_pr0045 |
| Test User (Manager) | mgr\_\<your\_prid\>   e.g. mgr\_pr0045 |
| Test User (Resolver) | res\_\<your\_prid\>   e.g. res\_pr0045 |

 

| ⚠ Naming Rules App ID must be unique across the landscape — use your PRID to avoid collisions. Use only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores. No spaces, hyphens, or special characters. The App ID cannot be changed after creation. |
| :---- |

