# **Concepts Recap — What You Learned in Session 4**

| Concept | What It Does | Naming / Config |
| :---- | :---- | :---- |
| VH Config | Static lists in metadata DB. Needs build after changes. For developer-managed fixed classifications. | vhc\_ prefix, CONFIG type |
| VH Query | Dynamic pickers from entity/query. Fetches live transactional data. For master data selection. | vhq\_ prefix, QUERY type |
| Key Property | The value stored in the entity when a VH item is selected. Internal ID. | Set in VH Detail — Key Property field |
| Display Text | What the user sees in the dropdown. Human-readable label. | Set in VH Detail — Display Text field |
| Desc Format | Controls how the selected value appears in the input field after selection. | ':key--:display' pattern |
| Is Restricted | Enforces VH validation — only known keys accepted. No free-text bypass. | Toggle on entity property |
| KloQuery (Modelled) | Reusable fetch definition with WHERE, JOIN, Sort in BOL Editor. Independent of DBMS. | q\_ prefix, Modelled Query type |
| Saved Query | Named pre-configured instance of a query. Quick-filter buttons in search section. | sq\_ prefix, created from Data Browser Advanced Search |
| vhType (F4/ComboBox/AutoComplete) | Controls how the VH renders in the UI input control. | Set in Page Data Model or control properties panel |

