| :---- | :---- | :---- |
| Controller TypeScript | UI orchestration only: formatters, model reads/writes for display, dashboard counts. | workspace/apps/\<app\>/p\_complaints.controller.ts |
| TransNode setProperty() | Updates a model property — triggers UI re-render immediately. | Controller function body |
| Vienable — Role | Visibility by role ID: EMPLOYEE, EMPLOYEE\_MANAGER, IT\_TEAM. | Vienable Dashboard → Role column |
