| Vienable — Page Mode | Visibility by DISPLAY/EDIT/CREATE. | Vienable Dashboard → Page Mode columns |
| \$SYSTEM.roleID | Runtime role ID of the logged-in user. Used in Entity/Query Rules for role checks. | oEvent.getTxn().\$SYSTEM.roleID in rules |
| onPageEnter | Controller hook fires after page data loads. Use for dashboard count calculations. | p\_complaint\_dashboard.controller.ts |

